# Faithless Looting discards a Lightning Bolt and a Darksteel Colossus together. Bot1 puts the Bolt on top of the library
# with Library of Leng and lets the Colossus be shuffled in (CR 616.1). The library is randomized except the Bolt, put in a
# certain position at the same time (CR 701.24g): it stays on top, alone, so nobody is asked to order anything. The shuffle
# is fixed to reverse what it shuffles ([Shuffles]): the Colossus, five Swamps and five Plains come out Plains first and the
# Colossus last, under the Bolt.
[Shuffles]
Reverse

[Bot1 Deck]
Library of Leng
Mox Jet
Mountain
Faithless Looting
Lightning Bolt
Darksteel Colossus
Plains
Forest
Forest
Swamp x5
Plains x5

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Library of Leng.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt; Darksteel Colossus)
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Replace(Darksteel Colossus)
! Bot1.Arrange
[T1 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Shuffles = 1
Bot1.Library = Lightning Bolt; Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains; Plains; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Darksteel Colossus
Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting
